  "title": "No-Cook, Large-Batch Fresh Tomatillo Salsa",
  "description": "This large batch of fresh salsa featuring tomatillos, chile peppers, and seasonings requires no cooking--just blend it up and let it sit overnight.",
  "authors": [
    "Georganna Gould Gore"
